OL,3,GNEWSACracked planters removed from high
OL,4,Astreet
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcrete planters which were criticised
OL,7,Ffor their appearance and then developed
OL,8,Fcracks have been removed.
OL,10,FThey were placed on Redcar high street
OL,11,Fearlier this year as part of a series
OL,12,Fof improvements funded through the
OL,13,FRedcar Town Deal, a regeneration scheme
OL,14,Fintroduced by the previous Conservative
OL,15,Fgovernment.
OL,17,FThe cracks were blamed on a design and
OL,18,Fmanufacturing defect and led to several
OL,19,Fof the blocks being temporarily
OL,20,Fstabilised due to health and safety
OL,21,Ffears.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
